# Module ownership

Applications may import packages. Packages must not import application code.

`contracts` must not depend on React, Fastify, filesystem access, or the TypeScript compiler.

`graph` receives plain normalized records, not compiler AST objects.

`parser-ts` uses an injected filesystem host. Pin `typescript@6.0.3`. Do not use TypeScript 7 as the parser.
